<main id="top">
  <section class="intro-band" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Systems that run themselves.</h1>
      <p>I'm Albert, a full-stack developer based in Australia and often in New Zealand. I look for the slow, manual parts of a business and build software that does them instead: process automation, LLM features, API integrations and data tools.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/assets/files/Albert_Jordaan_CV.pdf" download>Download CV</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="key" aria-label="Map key">
      <p>Each coloured area is a project and each line is something I built, coloured by the kind of work. Hover a stop to see what it does.</p>
      <div class="row"><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--purple)"></span>LLM &amp; AI features</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--teal)"></span>Process automation</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--rose)"></span>Testing &amp; workflow tools</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--blue)"></span>API integrations</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--red)"></span>Data &amp; performance</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--green)"></span>Media pipelines</span><span><span class="bar" style="background:var(--amber)"></span>UI/UX</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="map-wrap">
    <svg class="map" viewBox="0 0 1440 950" role="group" aria-label="System map of the projects Albert has built: Microkeeper, signalSEO and NFE"></svg>
