  <section class="about" id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <div>
      <p class="statement">I'm happiest where systems meet, <em>turning slow, manual work into software</em> that just runs.</p>
      <p class="more">I'm a full-stack developer who splits my time between Australia and New Zealand. I like connecting APIs, speeding up slow data, and making the screens people use every day easier to get through. Right now I'm getting signalSEO ready to launch and testing NFE's platform on contract, using Claude Code and Copilot every day and checking what they write before it ships.</p>
      <p class="more">Outside work you'll find me at the gym, catching up with friends, or deep in a board game or video game, with music on and my cats somewhere nearby. I'm usually first to try the newest AI tools, and then I work out which ones are actually worth using.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="facts">
      <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Victoria, Australia</dd></div>
